pts/2019/02/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q3-2019-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2019 Q3","e":"mod","d":"2019-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"As Tom described, these costs related to tariffs on imported materials and large price increases from certain domestic suppliers that are leveraging their current position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q3-2019-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2019 Q3","e":"mod","d":"2019-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"With regards to CIS and Building HVAC, we are generally able to pass through these cost increases in the normal course of business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q3-2019-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2019 Q3","e":"mod","d":"2019-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"In addition, we're benefiting from operational improvements and from the restructuring actions taken throughout last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q3-2019-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2019 Q3","e":"mod","d":"2019-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"These adjustments totaled $1.2 million and relate to strategy consulting fees, restructuring expenses, impairment charges and environmental charges related to previously owned manufacturing facilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q3-2019-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2019 Q4","e":"mod","d":"2019-05-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"Material costs have continued to have a negative impact on margins in our VTS segment, due to the direct and indirect impact of tariffs on our raw material purchases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/23/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2019 Q4","e":"mod","d":"2019-05-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"We report another solid year of revenue and earnings growth despite the significant headwinds resulting from the negative impact of tariffs on our Vehicular business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/23/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2019 Q4","e":"mod","d":"2019-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"These adjustments totaled $16.1 million in pertained to restructuring expenses, strategy consulting fees and environmental charges related to previously owned manufacturing facilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/23/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2019 Q4","e":"mod","d":"2019-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"The restructuring expenses are mostly severance costs at a European manufacturing location.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/23/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q1","e":"mod","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"They continue to be somewhat offset by the negative impact of tariffs on our earnings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q1","e":"mod","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"We also had cost related tariffs this quarter, but this was offset by lower commodity metal costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q1","e":"mod","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"We are focused on improving what we can control, and I am pleased with the improvements within our operations group and the procurement team is currently exceeding our cost savings targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q1","e":"mod","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"Another $1.8 million was primarily employee severance costs in Europe and the Americas within the VTS segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q1","e":"mod","d":"2019-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"Based on the latest trends and customer feedback, we are reducing our guidance to reflect additional market weakness, primarily in the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q2","e":"mod","d":"2019-11-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"Some of these are immediate actions that will drive short-term cost savings and some are longer-term initiatives, designed to deliver between $25 million and $30 million of annual savings over the next 18 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q2","e":"mod","d":"2019-11-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"The other $2.3 million relates primarily to VTS severance costs as we separate the automotive business and restructured the balance of VTS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q2","e":"mod","d":"2019-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"These conditions have led to our second quarter earnings being lower than we had originally expected and to a significantly lower outlook for the remainder of the fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q2","e":"mod","d":"2019-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"Based on recent results, sales trends, and customer feedback, we are reducing our guidance to reflect additional market weakness in the second half of our fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q3","e":"mod","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"As for other highlights during the quarter, I'm pleased to report that our free cash flow improved to $11.6 million this quarter, including auto separation and restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q3-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q3","e":"mod","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"We have initiated an aggressive cost reduction program to vertically integrate certain high cost components and to strengthen our manufacturing operations, and business processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q3-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q3","e":"mod","d":"2020-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Lucareli","x":"We are increasing our guidance on adjusted earnings per share, with a range of $0.85 to $1.00, due to a lower tax assumption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/modine-manufacturing-co-mod-q3-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MOD 2020 Q4","e":"mod","d":"2020-05-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Burke","x":"Well, I think we said, number one, we had a pass-through pricing in a pretty strong rate, which is the reason why we really e